66969592", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_29493146976969591_1233522940976851708_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eywPb9kNGOYQ7kNvwHV4xIT&_nc_oc=Adr9BnKp1igpa8UjMImFOh2E4faDvGCnu0MMzUZ8y760aBQPS0B7BZ7HSHspJ4aaxN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTOmoaQx_Y2br3vjRD3ybY2IxnpN3T5p9oOoQeIMOZ8wA&oe=6B0DB23C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1861254484899364", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_1861254491566030_5634349153622784571_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iw9-xnzTCywQ7kNvwETzByV&_nc_oc=AdrWtPgwEsJLbw2bDl-6vB1QX9Ib8X7xs7QWsnkhgJ2IycYsruoKQjxnDDoJjvsukkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRGOS1fga52iAQKu2-6SSywizZU5koSvTofaOtzbSd_iA&oe=6B0DBF0E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverTrailer.png", "id": "995291249706871", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/753328995_995291253040204_63032126255354788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vpCffG9BgY4Q7kNvwGrQ7TU&_nc_oc=AdrSm0lGyggLKVtVrwFQa0MPkhzCcjfKzFHMN3_s7aFErLczyYjgXHRngdHYT1F2Cms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSPqqR6Mb9brtz64m6hC8Uor_-2SnTXdQ2TYGUUFmentw&oe=6B0DCE85"}, "display_name": "Airborne Heroes : WW2 Shooter", "keywords": ["Action", "Online", "VR", "Shooting", "WW2"], "long_description": "Experience World War 2 in Airborne Heroes : WW2 Shooter a virtual reality multiplayer game.\nThe soldier is a paratrooper with lots of historical weapons, play the game in both single and multiplayer modes. An immersive VR action shooter built for Meta Quest.\n\nStep into the battlefield, handle realistic weapons with your own hands, connect with other players. coordinates with team players, play with friends, and compete in Team Deathmatch in this online shooting simulator.\n\n\u2b50 GAME FEATURES\n\u2b50 IMMERSIVE VR COMBAT: Experience World War II action in virtual reality.\n\u2b50 SINGLE PLAYER CAMPAIGN: Intense solo missions across historical battlefields.\n\u2b50 ONLINE MULTIPLAYER: Connect with players and fight together online.\n\u2b50 ALLIES VS. AXIS: Choose your side and join the multiplayer war.\n\u2b50 TEAM DEATH MATCH: Compete against other players in team based battles.\n\u2b50 HISTORICAL WEAPONS: Handle and use WWII weapons.\n\u2b50 PARACHUTE LANDINGS: Experience thrilling airborne operations.\n\u2b50 DAY & NIGHT ENVIRONMENTS: Fight across different battlefield settings.\n\u2b50 REALISTIC WEAPON HANDLING: Aim, reload, and engage using your own hands in VR.\n\nEnter the VR war in a parachute landing, join the military squad and experience all aspects of the war game, airborne combat in day and night settings. Join the battle in online Allies vs. Axis.\n\nFight other players across different environments. Engage enemy soldiers in the historical war game.", "short_description": "Welcome to the world of VR combat in Meta Quest, a World War 2 shooting game. Fight cinematic single player battles to multiplayer online combat, Allies vs Axis across day and night. Jump as a paratrooper in this immersive VR shooter. Use hand controlled weapons and complete cinematic missions in this historical war game.\nJoin the battle, jump into the combat, grab your weapon and fight as a soldier in this action game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://airborneheroes.bytenests.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bytenests", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://airborneheroes.bytenests.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "26918